                                                "sense_id": "fc5717f6-d70e-343a-b6c2-7a7c633a750d",
                                                "text": "Redding’s study asked four psychologists with expertise in anxiety and depressive disorders to rate each self-help book on five criteria: how scientifically grounded the book is; whether there are guidelines for self-diagnosis, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
